        "uid": "BfDiy2hMk"
      },
      "description": "One row per banned address and jail. Ban # counts this address's bans in this jail: from the second on, the ban time doubles (1 h, 2 h, 4 h ... up to 1 week) on the sshd and traefik-scan jails. Click an address to look it up.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
